## Stabilizing photo-induced vacancy defects in MOF matrix for high-performance SERS detection
Hongzhao Sun<sup>1,2</sup>, Ge Song<sup>1,2</sup>, Wenbin Gong<sup>2,5</sup>, Weibang Lu<sup>1,2</sup>, Shan Cong<sup>1,2,3</sup> (✉), and Zhigang Zhao<sup>1,2,4</sup> (✉)
